{"name":"Tower Threespires","status":"ok","title":"Tower Threespires","pageId":174007,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-building\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tower Threespires</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tower</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dunwood\" title=\"Dunwood\">Dunwood</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Dale\" title=\"Great Dale\">Great Dale</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"built\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Built</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/890_DR\" title=\"890 DR\">Year of the Burning Tree, 890 DR</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p122_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p122-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"owner\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Owner(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2x5bXBoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Clymph (page does not exist)\">Clymph</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/890_DR\" title=\"890 DR\">890 DR</a><br/> <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druids</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Leth\" title=\"Circle of Leth\">Circle of Leth</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p122_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p122-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>Tower Threespires</b> was an overgrown <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a> tower in the eastern edge of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dunwood\" title=\"Dunwood\">Dunwood</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Dale\" title=\"Great Dale\">Great Dale</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p115_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p115-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Structure\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Structure</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Structure\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_Threespires?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At a distance, this ruined wizards tower looked like a giant three-fingered hand reaching out of the Dunwood towards the sky. The three towers stabbed out from a broad-based construction of stone, which would've collapsed many years previously if not held together by a great network of vines wrapping themselves around every inch of the three towers. Were the vines to wither and lose their cohesion, the entire tower complex would come crashing down. The peak of the north tower contained a <i><a href=\"/wiki/Portal\" title=\"Portal\">portal</a></i> to <a href=\"/wiki/Clymph_Tower\" title=\"Clymph Tower\">Clymph Tower</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p119_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p119-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_Threespires?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Nar_demonbinder\" title=\"Nar demonbinder\">Nar demonbinder</a> <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2x5bXBoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Clymph (page does not exist)\">Clymph</span> built this tower in the <a href=\"/wiki/890_DR\" title=\"890 DR\">Year of the Burning Tree, 890 DR</a>, two years after creating his fortress of Clymph Tower. He linked the two by a permanent <i>portal</i>, making this the only way to enter or leave the sealed Clymph Tower.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p122_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p122-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p119_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p119-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_Threespires?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, the tower was inhabited by a small group of <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druids</a>, all descendants of those chosen personally by the <a href=\"/wiki/Nentyarch\" title=\"Nentyarch\">Nentyarch</a> leader of the <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Leth\" title=\"Circle of Leth\">Circle of Leth</a>, to be part of a special order of guardians several centuries earlier. They were to protect the lands and forests against the <a href=\"/wiki/Demon\" title=\"Demon\">demons</a> held in Clymph Tower. Every year on the <a href=\"/wiki/Feast_of_the_Moon\" title=\"Feast of the Moon\">Feast of the Moon</a>, they performed a ritual to maintain the <i>portal</i> seal, preventing any trapped demon from slipping out into the Great Dale. While the druids were no longer sure if the ritual was necessary or whether any demons still lingered in Clymph Tower, they nonetheless still performed their appointed task of securing the Tower and Portal both.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p119_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p119-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Long isolation had made the druids suspicious of strangers, never allowing anyone else to enter the tower, no matter how dire the situation, in fear of the <i>portal</i> unsealing and thus their duty to fail.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-UE-p119_3-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p119-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_Threespires?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tower_Threespires?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-UE-p122-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p122_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p122_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p122_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matt_Forbeck\" title=\"Matt Forbeck\">Matt Forbeck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a> (May 2003). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Unapproachable East (sourcebook)\">Unapproachable East</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 122. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\">0-7869-2881-6</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-UE-p115-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p115_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matt_Forbeck\" title=\"Matt Forbeck\">Matt Forbeck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a> (May 2003). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Unapproachable East (sourcebook)\">Unapproachable East</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 115. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\">0-7869-2881-6</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-UE-p119-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p119_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p119_3-1\">3.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p119_3-2\">3.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p119_3-3\">3.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matt_Forbeck\" title=\"Matt Forbeck\">Matt Forbeck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a> (May 2003). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Unapproachable East (sourcebook)\">Unapproachable East</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 119. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\">0-7869-2881-6</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260517065041\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 793/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4501/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2344/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 12/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3054/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1503928/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   92.103      1 -total\n 73.96%   68.117      1 Template:Building\n 39.85%   36.700      2 Template:YearlinkName\n 17.73%   16.334      1 Template:Refs\n  8.38%    7.721      3 Template:Cite_book/Unapproachable_East\n  7.02%    6.468      3 Template:Cite_book\n  5.31%    4.892      3 Template:Cite_publication\n  1.53%    1.413      3 Template:FormatAlias\n  1.22%    1.126      1 Template:Th\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:174007-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260517065041 and revision id 997092. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&format=json&prop=text&page=Tower%20Threespires","fetchedAt":"2026-05-17T07:01:51